  <div class="section no-top-padding"><div class="container"><div class="hero4" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0"><h1>Terms of use</h1><div class="hero-arrow"><img alt="arrow down" class="hero-arrow-image" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-1e6e73d27d5690.svg" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 24PX, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 24PX, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 24PX, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 24PX, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0)"/></div></div></div></div><div class="section no-top-padding"><div class="container"><div class="hero-paragraph"><p class="paragraph-16">Welcome to Toile Blanche. By accessing or using our services, you agree to be bound by the following terms and conditions (the "Terms of Use"). If you do not agree to these Terms of Use, you may not access or use our services.<br/><br/>Use of Services<br/><br/>Our services are intended for individuals who are 18 years of age or older. By accessing or using our services, you represent and warrant that you are 18 years of age or older and that you agree to and will abide by these Terms of Use.<br/><br/>Reservations and Payment<br/><br/>To make a reservation at our hotel, you must provide us with valid payment information and comply with any other requirements that we may impose. We reserve the right to cancel or modify reservations where it appears that a customer has engaged in fraudulent or inappropriate activity or under other circumstances where it appears that the reservations contain or resulted from a mistake or error.<br/><br/>Cancellation and Refunds<br/><br/>You may cancel your reservation at any time, but please note that we may charge cancellation fees. If you cancel your reservation, we will refund you the amount you paid for your stay, minus any cancellation fees that may apply.<br/><br/>Hotel Policies<br/><br/>You must comply with all hotel policies, including but not limited to our check-in and check-out times, pet policies, and smoking policies. We reserve the right to ask you to leave the hotel if you violate any of our policies.<br/><br/>Prohibited Activities<br/><br/>You may not engage in any activities that are illegal, harmful, or offensive while using our services or staying at our hotel. This includes, but is not limited to, activities such as prostitution, drug use, and theft.<br/><br/>Indemnification<br/><br/>You agree to indemnify, defend, and hold harmless Toile Blanche, its officers, directors, employees, agents, licensors, and suppliers from and against all losses, expenses, damages, and costs, including reasonable attorneys' fees, resulting from any violation of these Terms of Use or any activity related to your account (including negligent or wrongful conduct) by you or any other person accessing the site using your account.<br/><br/>Disclaimer<br/><br/>OUR SERVICES ARE PROVIDED "AS IS" AND "AS AVAILABLE." WE DISCLAIM ANY WARRANTIES, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO IMPLIED WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE, AND NON-INFRINGEMENT. WE DO NOT WARRANT THAT OUR SERVICES WILL BE AVAILABLE AT ANY PARTICULAR TIME OR LOCATION, WILL BE SECURE OR ERROR-FREE, THAT ANY DEFECTS WILL BE CORRECTED, OR THAT OUR SERVICES ARE FREE OF VIRUSES OR OTHER HARMFUL COMPONENTS.<br/><br/>Limitation of Liability<br/><br/>IN NO EVENT SHALL WE BE LIABLE FOR ANY DIRECT, INDIRECT, PUNITIVE, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, CONSEQUENTIAL DAMAGES OR ANY DAMAGES WHATSOEVER INCLUDING, WITHOUT LIMITATION, DAMAGES FOR LOSS OF USE, DATA OR PROFITS, ARISING OUT OF OR IN ANY WAY CONNECTED WITH THE USE OR PERFORMANCE OF OUR SERVICES, WITH THE DELAY OR INABILITY TO USE OUR SERVICES, OR FOR ANY INFORMATION, SOFTWARE, PRODUCTS, SERVICES AND RELATED GRAPHICS OBTAINED THROUGH OUR SERVICES, OR OTHERWISE ARISING OUT OF THE USE OF OUR SERVICES, WHETHER BASED ON CONTRACT, TORT, NEGLIGENCE, STRICT LIABILITY OR OTHERWISE</p></div></div></div>

